      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This issue still seems to be occurring at times as of build 1048. Friend sent me an invite, I typed \"I'll join in a few, checking a world out\" and instead of getting my custom message, my friend got the default message, and not just that, the wrong kind.\nThey invited me somewhere and my custom messaged defaulted to \"sorry, the instance I'm in is full!\" according to them, so not only is my custom response not going through but also the wrong default message for the wrong invite type.",
